        "text": "**Content** is what gives a website its meaning. Before a designer thinks about colors or layout, they need to decide what the audience should learn, notice, feel, or do. Strong content is not just a collection of facts. It is information chosen for a purpose. It helps the audience understand the topic and gives every part of the page a reason to be there. (**Note:** for this condensed activity, there are 3 sample content plans or, time permitting, a Build-Your-Own template)",
